# The state beside the module is served over a unix socket, the way Sui carries its own: two
# processes and the socket between them, which is the whole rendezvous. No service name is
# registered -- a name that differs with every installation could never be granted.
#
# The root domain is not written down here: it is whatever this device has, and the installer fills
# it in from what it is running as.
allow system_server %su_secon% unix_stream_socket { connectto getattr getopt read write }
